---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="LibreFit - Let's build it together"
  description="Discover how you can improve LibreFit."
  canonical="/donate"
>
  <div class="content-card">
    <h1 class="md-typescale-display-small bold">Let's build it together ❤️</h1>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large ">
      LibreFit is a passion project, built by one person who believes software should be open,
      simple, beautiful, and above all, respectful of your privacy.
    </p>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">
      I pour countless hours into designing, coding, and refining every detail to create the best
      possible experience. It's a commitment to you, the user, and to a better digital world.
    </p>
    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">
      LibreFit is only possible with your support, whether by donating or by contributing to code
      or translations. Check <a href="https://github.com/LibreFitOrg/LibreFit/CONTRIBUTING.md">GitHub</a> to know how to contribute to the project. If you want to donate instead, see below.
    </p>
    <p class="md-typescale-title-medium">
      All donators and contributors get the supporter version and a credit in the app and on GitHub.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h1 class="md-typescale-headline-large bold">
      Donate
    </h1>

    <label class="form-group md-typescale-body-large">If you want to send a message to
    appreciate/comment/request alongside your donation, visit <a href="/contact.html">contact page</a>.</label>

    <h2 class="md-typescale-headline-small">
      Direct donation
    </h2>

    <p class="md-typescale-body-large">
      Direct donations are tricky to track (so <b>no supporter code</b> and no credit) but they
      provide the greatest privacy, minimal fees and no minimum amount. Monero address below:
    </p>

    <pre class="content-card-code">842RPDZ851EitDZZxCEp1sjjyDpsaV74xAJBTPU6X7TrDAbpDrjq5rRfaF3Q8PnXyQeUYs2xLoxFpZb7ZpSJxBvdDgFVpww</pre>

    <h2 class="md-typescale-headline-small">
      Integrated processor
    </h2>

    <form action="/donations/create" method="POST">
      <label class="block mb-4 md-typescale-body-large" for="amount_usd">You will be redirected to <a href="https://trocador.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Trocador</a> to complete your donation with the cryptocurrency of your choice.</label>

      <div class="mb-4">
        <label for="username" class="block mb-2 md-typescale-title-small">[Optional] Insert a name/username/alias (and eventual GitHub username/website/email) in order to be credited in README.md and LibreFit's about.</label>
        <input type="text" id="username" name="username" class="md-text-field">
      </div>

      <div class="mb-4">
        <input type="checkbox" id="use-xmr" name="use-xmr">   I want to use Monero
      </div>

      <label class="form-group md-typescale-title-medium">To request your supporter code, save immediately your DONATION ID when it's shown.</label>

      <div class="mt-6">
        <button type="submit" class="md-filled-button">Donate crypto</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <hr>

    <h1 class="md-typescale-headline-large bold">Get supporter code</h1>

    <h2 class="md-typescale-headline-medium">Donators</h2>
    <p>Once you have donated, insert your DONATION ID to receive your supporter code.</p>

    <form action="/donations/status" method="GET">
      <label for="id" class="block mb-2">DONATION ID:</label>
      <input
        type="text"
        id="id"
        name="id"
        placeholder="e.g., c02831c7-0de2-474b-84ca-9d622cec062b"
        required
        maxlength="36"
        minlength="36"
        title="Enter a valid ID with UUID v4 format"
        pattern="[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-4[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}"
        class="md-text-field"
      >

      <div class="mt-6">
        <button type="submit" class="md-filled-button w-full">Check donation status</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <h2 class="md-typescale-headline-medium">Contributors</h2>
    <p>Once your pull request is merged, login below with your Github account to receive your supporter code.</p>

    <a href="/contributors/login" class="md-filled-button text-on-primary no-underline hover:no-underline focus-visible:no-underline">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined">login</span>
      GitHub login
    </a>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>